{
  "id": "solar",
  "name": "Solar",
  "order": 1,
  "verified": true,
  "_doc": [
    "REFERENCE FILE. Every other splat copies this shape. Numbers here are derived from Solar.xlsx",
    "and match canonical Exalted 2e.",
    "",
    "XP MODEL: a trait costs nothing up to max(floors[kind], granted). Above that, each dot from",
    "n-1 to n costs   mult * (n - 1) + base   using the 'favored' spec when the trait is caste/favored,",
    "otherwise 'normal'. Abilities additionally use firstDot / favoredFirstDot for the 0 -> 1 step.",
    "",
    "POOLS: linear coefficient maps. Available keys: essence, willpower, virtuesSum, highestVirtue,",
    "twoHighestVirtues, lowestVirtue, breeding, flat. Anything absent counts as 0.",
    "",
    "CASTE vs FAVORED: casteKind says what the caste grants (\"ability\", \"attribute\" or \"none\").",
    "favoredAbilities / favoredAttributes each carry `picks` (how many the player may choose) and",
    "`always` (ids that are favored for every character of this type, e.g. Survival for Lunars).",
    "",
    "ABILITY GROUPS: the Abilities block is laid out by `abilityGroups`. When that field is absent",
    "and casteKind is \"ability\", the caste list is used as the layout, which is what every",
    "Celestial and Terrestrial sheet does."
  ],

  "casteLabel": "Caste",
  "casteKind": "ability",
  "favoredAbilities": { "picks": 5, "always": [] },
  "favoredAttributes": { "picks": 0, "always": [] },
  "craftTypes": ["Air", "Earth", "Fire", "Water", "Wood", "Glamour"],
  "accent": "#e0a83c",
